        "title": "Definition of the arccos",
        "text": "There is an angle $$0$$ $$\\leq$$ $$\\theta$$ $$\\leq$$ $$\\pi$$ such that $$\\arccos(-\\sqrt{2}/2)=\\theta$$",
        "variabilization": {},
        "oer": "",
