        ],
        "title": "Important right triangles",
        "text": "The right triangle with adjacent side length $$\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$$ and hypotenuse $$1$$ is the isosceles right triangle where the angle is $$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$$\\n##figure1.gif##",
